FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1786963674
OL,3,CUkraine launches one of its largest
OL,4,Caerial attacks on Russia since war
OL,5,Cbegan
OL,7,FRussia's Ministry of Defence said it
OL,8,Fhad destroyed 822 Ukrainian drones
OL,9,Fovernight.
OL,11,FAround 600 drones were detected
OL,12,Fheading towards the Russian capital,
OL,13,FMoscow Mayor Sergei Sobyanin said,
OL,14,Fwith a third destroyed over the Moscow
OL,15,Fregion itself.
OL,17,FAn 83-year-old man was killed after a
OL,18,FUkrainian drone struck a private home
OL,19,Fin the Moscow region, local Governor
OL,20,FAndrey Vorobyov said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/5
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1786963674
OL,3,CUkraine launches one of its largest
OL,4,Caerial attacks on Russia since war
OL,5,Cbegan
OL,7,FHe also confirmed that a Ukrainian
OL,8,Fattack had sparked a fire at a
OL,9,Fwarehouse belonging to Russian retail
OL,10,Fgiant Wildberries.
OL,12,FImages shared by Russian media outlets
OL,13,Ffrom the town of Podolsk showed
OL,14,Fcolumns of black smoke rising from the
OL,15,Fsite.
OL,17,FFive people were also killed in
OL,18,FRussia's southwestern Rostov region,
OL,19,Fwhere three towns came under attack,
OL,20,Flocal Governor Yury Slyusar said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/5
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
