CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1786963674
OL,3,CUkraine launches one of its largest
OL,4,Caerial attacks on Russia since war
OL,5,Cbegan
OL,7,FThis comes as a Russian attack on Kyiv
OL,8,Fsparked fires throughout the Ukrainian
OL,9,Fcapital and injured six people.
OL,11,F"Wherever the Russians can reach with
OL,12,Ftheir ballistic missiles, they strike
OL,13,Fcivilian infrastructure," Zelenskyy
OL,14,Fsaid.
OL,16,F"Since this morning, air raid alerts
OL,17,Fhave continued in many regions ` the
OL,18,FRussians launched another wave of
OL,19,Fdrones."
